<title>ARGENTINA: Banco Galicia to pay $31 mln for Sudecor stake.</title>
<headline>Banco Galicia to pay $31 mln for Sudecor stake.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Banco de Galicia said Wednesday it will pay $31 million for its 49 percent purchase of provincial Banco Sudecor.</p>
<p>Under the deal announced earlier Wednesday, Banco Galicia said Sudecor will make a share offering of about 49 percent of its capital, or 312,000 shares, which will be purchased by Galicia for 31 million pesos.</p>
<p>The deal includes an &quot;irrevocable option&quot; for Galicia to buy Sudecor's voting ordinary shares, expanding its stake to 75 percent. No financial details about the option were disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Axel Bugge, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668</p>
</text>
